{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S07-S11一度偏向是否回去、如何安顿当下的选择问题，使反复拉扯略带有现实决策色彩。\",\n    \"S09将对旧日生活与归属的怀念部分收束为舍不得被当作自己人的日子与害怕孤单之间的矛盾。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S08-S09把对旧日生活及归属的怀念转向难过时有人陪伴、遇事不必独自承担的需求，将核心对象部分替换成了泛化的陪伴需求。\",\n    \"S11-S13逐渐突出不因孤单而回头、不再忍受委屈的自我坚持，旧日生活及归属的复杂怀念相对退居背景。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X更持续地把维护尊严的坚持与对旧日生活、被当作自己人的怀念交织起来，两者反复唤起、抵消和改变彼此。Y也具备两方面，但中段更明显地转向对陪伴的需要，使怀念的对象从旧日生活与归属缩窄为缓解孤独。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b8de0ae1-2ae9-435d-a8bd-ba2776714684", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T101531344421Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:15:58.556858+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "62df81d8eff3be97d49ff59f2254ce1f69ee6e7e9ba69097d36ebde364dc8220", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachm